aigiu.","Būtų puiku, ačiū!","Taip, prašau.","Ne, man ir taip gerai, ačiū.","Taip, truputį."],"turns":[[0,"¡Hola! Estoy pintando el templo.","Hi! I'm painting the temple.","c1c76feb4c8f",3.29],[0,"¿Te gusta?","Do you like it?","d472d1e51fa8",0.7],[-1,"¿Qué pintas?","What do you paint?",1],[0,"El templo y el mar. Siempre el mar.","The temple and the sea. Always the sea.","e2746d58a28d",4.7],[-1,"Pintas muy bien.","You paint very well.",1],[0,"¡Gracias! Todavía no está terminada.","Thanks! It isn't finished yet.","bfd72413aff5",4.56],[0,"Vengo cada tarde, por la luz.","I come every afternoon, for the light.","19d31f257eb0",2.61],[0,"¿Y tú? ¿Pintas o dibujas?","And you? Do you paint or draw?","03a8799bd655",3.21],[-1,"¿Vendes tus pinturas?","Do you sell your paintings?",1],[0,"Algunas, en el mercado, los sábados.","Some of them, at the market, on Saturdays.","824fbdb19e1c",3.51],[-1,"No, gracias.","No, thanks.",1],[0,"Nunca es tarde para empezar.","It's never too late to start.","aee4e1f17bd5",2],[0,"Sube al templo: la vista es preciosa.","Go up to the temple: the view is lovely.","aee8f2e74889",3.68],[-1,"Me gusta mucho.","I like it a lot.",1],[-1,"¡Muchas gracias!","Thank you very much!",1],[0,"¡De nada!","You're welcome!","da5e695559d6",1.29],[-1,"¡Claro, gracias!","Sure, thanks!",1],[0,"¡Qué bien! Trae tus lápices la próxima vez.","How nice! Bring your pencils next time.","392d34281c55",3.67],[-1,"Es muy bonita.","It's very pretty.",1],[-1,"No, pero me gusta el arte.","No, but I like art.",1],[0,"¡Hola otra vez! Mira, ya casi termino.","Hi again! Look, I'm almost done.","fb1663c09cd9",4.15],[-1,"¡Sería genial, gracias!","That would be great, thanks!",1],[-1,"Sí, por favor.","Yes, please.",1],[-1,"No, así estoy bien, gracias.","No, I'm good, thanks.",1],[-1,"Sí, un poco.","Yes, a little.",1]],"contexts":[{"sim":2,"visits":0,"seed":3},{"sim":0,"visits":0,"seed":1},{"sim":1,"visits":0,"seed":2},{"visits":1,"seed":1},{"sim":3,"visits":0,"seed":4},{"visits":0,"seed":1},{